  "project_description": "Paragraph Bootstrap Carousel module provides a easy way to create bootstrap carousels with paragraphs\n\n After installation it will add a new Bootstrap carousel in the paragraphs type. You can use it to create a new field paragraph.\n\n- in the display manage, select option Paragraph Bootstrap Carousel.\n\n- mapping field. Field image is required\n\n- if you don't select Field caption, it will generate paragraphs with display mode\n\n- if you want render image origin you can set Image style = Original Image. Now you can define field image formater Image / Responsive image / url image\n\n- Use with Responsive Image (you can define breakpoint image in paragraphs) Module for Mobile Carousels\n\n Version 8.x-1.1 support bootstrap 4 \n\n Version 2.x.x support bootstrap 5 carousel \n\nI tried to mix the two versions but it doesn't work well so I think it's better with 2 separate versions, version 2 support bootstrap 5 , but it supports also bootstrap 4 but you should fix 2 buttons left right with your own css\n\n Best support for Bootstrap 5 admin theme\n\n Do you like this module? Show your appreciation by buying me ☕ .",
